|{{HistoryLine||March 16, 2011|link={{tweet|jeb_|48037113270251520}}|[[File:Wolf (pre-release 2).png|42px]] [[File:Sitting Wolf (pre-release 2).png|42px]] Jeb posted a second image of wolves, with updated texture and model, showing one of them in a sitting pose.}}
